# Test files must never become Serverless Functions.
#
# vercel.json's `functions` glob is "api/**/*.ts", which matches every .ts file
# under api/ — including *.test.ts. Each match is built and deployed as its own
# Function, so the 17 test files here were being published as public endpoints
# and counted against the deployment's Function limit. Adding six merchant tests
# in ae392fc pushed the count past that limit and the deployment failed at
# "Deploying outputs".
#
# Vitest reads these from the repository (vitest.config.ts include:
# "api/**/*.test.ts"), never from the deployment, so excluding them from upload
# changes nothing about the test suite.
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
